            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Uniform overtime records will be maintained in accordance with the above paragraph in a manner determined by the respective overtime center. The overtime records will be posted in the overtime center and updated weekly. The Department Steward and the Supervisor will meet once a month to review overtime records in each overtime center.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                92,
